# The Visitor Design Pattern in Java: A Complete Guide

![Visitor Design Pattern](https://placeholder.pics/svg/800x400/DEDEDE/555555/Visitor%20Design%20Pattern)

> **Note:** The image above is a placeholder diagram. The Visitor pattern is one of the most conceptually interesting patterns in the Gang of Four catalog — and one of the most misunderstood. This article will walk you through it step by step, with real Java code you can run today.

---

