# The Visitor Design Pattern in Java: A Complete, Easy-to-Understand Guide

![Visitor Design Pattern](https://refactoring.guru/images/patterns/diagrams/visitor/structure.png)

*Image source: [Refactoring Guru – Visitor Pattern](https://refactoring.guru/design-patterns/visitor)*

## Table of Contents

